\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Conduction-regime classification of the four resistance-state segments of the S1 representative cycle, using the common-response fit. LRS segments are ohmic ($R^2\ge 0.98$); HRS segments are barrier-limited, with a Schottky-like window where the implied permittivity is admissible and other windows that are near-ohmic or flagged ambiguous. PF candidates with nonphysical $\varepsilon _r^{\mathrm  {dyn}}$ are rejected.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
