\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Fisher relative (log-coordinate) uncertainty $\sigma _{\qopname  \relax o{log}\theta }$ (log color scale) for the 16 active parameters across the twelve conditions, shown as a corroborating cross-check. The Fisher matrix is rank deficient (numerical rank $\approx 8$--$14/16$), so individual coordinates are not certified from this diagnostic alone; conclusions are drawn only where it agrees with Fig.\nobreakspace  {}6\hbox {}.}}{7}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:ident}{{7}{7}}
